@startuml
[*] --> ApplicationRunning

ApplicationRunning --> AddingRecipe : Add Recipe
AddingRecipe --> RecipeAdded : Recipe Added
RecipeAdded --> ApplicationRunning : Return to Application

ApplicationRunning --> EditingRecipe : Edit Recipe
EditingRecipe --> RecipeEdited : Recipe Edited
RecipeEdited --> ApplicationRunning : Return to Application

ApplicationRunning --> DeletingRecipe : Delete Recipe
DeletingRecipe --> RecipeDeleted : Recipe Deleted
RecipeDeleted --> ApplicationRunning : Return to Application

ApplicationRunning --> SearchingRecipes : Search Recipes
SearchingRecipes --> SearchResultsDisplayed : Search Results Displayed
SearchResultsDisplayed --> ApplicationRunning : Return to Application

ApplicationRunning --> [*] : Exit
@enduml
